  "foot": {
    "text": "Illustrative ordering only; no fixed latency is implied. Issue and register are coupled (X_ISSUE_REGISTER_SPLIT=0). No non-kill commit or DMA occurs in the issue cycle. N is authorized only after the older load resolves; N+1 is separately authorized while N computes, allowing its descriptor read to overlap. Descriptor ownership is internal context tracking; AXI IDs are not CV-X-IF IDs. Only header address handshakes are shown. Header data and body fetches are omitted."
